        "text": "## Image + voice example\nUpload your character picture and voice clip in the two Context nodes before queueing.\nUse distinct names; speaker points to Character.\nChoose the locally installed fl2va/ref2va checkpoints, CLIP and VAEs.\nThe native loop uses the same sampler and collector as the text example.\nPresets and analysis are optional and never run during rendering."
